          "snippet": "# Synthetic note: optimal filtering and neural networks\n\nThis synthetic note compares optimal filtering with a neural network for the energy\nreconstruction of pulses from a liquid argon calorimeter.\n\nOptimal filtering minimises the noise variance of the amplitude estimate. A small\nneural network can recover the amplitude when pulses overlap.\n\nAll numbers and statements in this note are invented test material.",
